From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 17:52:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(agents): header ribbon settings in the agent's General
 tab

Adds a Header Ribbon block to the Appearance form: text (empty turns it
off), icon, dismissable or always shown, background and text colour with a
live preview. Saved as theme.ribbon in the agent's theme JSON
({text, dismissable, icon?, background?, text_color?}); the agent-config API
returns theme as-is, and the widget loader maps it (synapse-sdk). Hex colours
and a fixed icon list are enforced on save. No migration.

